        },
        "quote": "(a) All nonconforming signs that were lawful prior to October 1, 2019, and not abandoned may continue without being brought into conformance with this chapter if no alterations are proposed to the sign or property. Except as provided in this section, a nonconforming sign may not be altered in such a manner as to augment the nonconforming condition, nor may illumination be added.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.110:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.110 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "1353cdef-8f95-5187-b211-8195946d9dc7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 808,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.110:block:1",
          "start": 382
        },
        "quote": "(b) Except as provided in subsection (c) of this section, the sign shall conform to the standards of this chapter if the sign is altered, other than a reface or sign maintenance. As an alternative to compliance with the dimensional standards in TMC 18.10.130 , any freestanding sign at a nonconforming height or area may be altered provided its height and area are reduced by 34 percent or more of its current height and area.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.110:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.110 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "d7971810-89a7-5a74-8c25-0bfcf91c5f92",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1060,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.110:block:2",
          "start": 809
        },
        "quote": "(c) In addition, any reface or alteration of copy shall at a minimum achieve partial compliance by reducing its corresponding sign area or height by at least 34 percent if the change accompanies one of the following events on or after October 1, 2019:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.110:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.110 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "89a86f9f-6661-52eb-a456-2499362e9422",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1118,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.110:block:3",
          "start": 1061
        },
        "quote": "(1) Rezoning of the property at the request of the owner.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.110:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.110 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "29309015-a27f-5cd8-b2d3-c0a071a6aec9",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1204,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.110:block:4",
          "start": 1119
        },
        "quote": "(2) Fifty percent or more of the primary structure is damaged or rendered not usable.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.110:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.110 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "cc061cae-6084-54e2-97c6-b96c27df3918",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1280,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.110:block:5",
          "start": 1205
        },
        "quote": "(3) Any major building addition/expansion that requires site plan approval.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.110:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.110 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "eb6057c6-6c90-52c7-b078-28ae87322a40",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1365,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.110:block:6",
          "start": 1281
        },
        "quote": "(4) Any major facade renovation that requires approval of building elevation design.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.110:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.110 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "f1a99c78-fbde-552c-8e66-3c3f5bc15329",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1510,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.110:block:7",
          "start": 1366
        },
        "quote": "(5) Any property that is included in a neighborhood revitalization plan, a tax-increment financing district or a community improvement district.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.110:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.110 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "492e6da4-1876-5625-a985-665b6200ea2a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1611,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.110:block:8",
          "start": 1511
        },
        "quote": "(d) Any sign height reduced to 25 feet or less in height must conform to monument sign requirements.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.110:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
